        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        },
        "markdown": "# If You Have to Watch Just One CANDACE OWENS Piece This Is the One\\n\\nA 21-minute Lionel Nation commentary published July 16, 2026. Lionel introduces and repeatedly pauses a Candace Owens segment about Helen Comperatore's questions following the Butler shooting, then uses it to discuss public skepticism, grief, Erika Kirk, and reactions to questions about Charlie Kirk's assassination.\\n\\nAllegations and judgments are attributed to the speakers; this graph does not present them as independently established facts."
      }
    },
